  "description": "A concurrent, high-performance terminal UI framework for .NET. Build multi-pane console applications with developer-defined region layouts, thread-safe pane writes, streaming markdown, mutable lines, a smart scroll lock, correct Unicode width, enhanced keyboard input, mouse and links, modals and notifications, a widget toolkit, theming, and headless rendering for tests. Alpha: API and capabilities are subject to change.",
